{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53700","headline":"九日黄白二菊花盛开对怀刘二十八 · 令狐楚","name":"九日黄白二菊花盛开对怀刘二十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西花虽未谢，二菊又初芳。\n鬓云徒云白，腰金未是黄。\n曙花淩露彩，宵艳射星芒。\n日正开边树，风清发更香。\n山椒应散乱，篱下倍荧煌。\n泛酒遥相忆，何由共醉狂。\n（见蒲积中《古今岁时杂咏》卷三五）（按：此诗原署「相公」，其次爲刘禹锡和诗「素萼迎寒秀」云云，检刘诗收《刘宾客外集》卷四，题作《和令狐相公九日对黄白二菊花见怀》，知此诗爲楚作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}